# apps/portal

- Authenticated directory dashboards: listings, claim, field ops, bookings, vendor.
- Session is demo token in `localStorage` (`nusa.session`) until Better Auth lands.
- Call API through `src/api.ts`; do not duplicate business rules in the UI.
- Role gates: owner / field_agent / admin — match API checks.
